																		A Threadbare Childhood
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/absentmindednihilist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2812984); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2812984&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833921" alt="AbsentmindedNihilist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2812984)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/absentmindednihilist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2812984); return false;" >AbsentmindedNihilist</a></span> <span class="odate time_1585251134 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">26 Mar 2020 19:32</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4566225">
									

<p><em>chrome don't crash on me this time you fucker</em></p>
<p>This is my shortest piece to date. Perhaps not coincidentally, it took me under 8 hours to write - my shortest time spent on a piece ever. This evolved and grew into its full form so quickly it's honestly somewhat terrifying.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>This is who you think it is. This was inspired by ARD's 3220. What 3220 is to 173, this is to 231. 231 is a blustery and dramatic piece about the world's worst act being perpetrated for the safety of all. The girl is a narrative object meant to stoke our fears about this horrible thing being done. She's not a person, because if the Foundation recognized her as a person, they couldn't possibly continue.</p>
<p>The DoA, in my mind, is a larval, base, shadow archetype of the Foundation. Ergo, this article is an inversion of the original. The DoA will not let you forget that this is a little girl. She is suffering the worst kind of abuse in a tiny world that consists of two rooms and a hallway. This does not erase her inherent status as a little girl.</p>
<p>She has a childhood - a washed out, neglectful, pitiful childhood, that has just enough attention paid to it that readers can compare it to their own younger years and find it lacking and terrible, but she is a child and she is real, and she lived here. The DoA will not let the Foundation forget that.</p>
<p>And to answer the question that I keep getting: it doesn't matter what the stuff is on her doggie's fur. It could be semen, tears, vomit, anything. All that matters is that her only soft toy was dirty, and no longer soft.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Huge thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1585252078" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;">A Random Day</a></span> for helping me guide this piece into completion, and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1585252078" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;">Captain Kirby</a></span> for the title and helping me punch up the ending. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187161); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187161&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1585252078" alt="plaidypus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187161)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187161); return false;">plaidypus</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5376871); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5376871&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1585252078" alt="gee0765" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5376871)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5376871); return false;">gee0765</a></span> also looked at this, and for that I am grateful. Thank you for reading.</p>

							</div>

								
